  Slug: school-of-ars-grammatica
  DisplayName: School of Ars Grammatica
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-eye-purple.webp
  Description: "Runes and wards, numbers and letters\u2014they underpin all magic,
    making them the logical subject for a wizard who studies fundamental forces.
    Perhaps you studied at the Pathfinder Society's School of Spells or a similar
    institution, but whether you're lacing your words with magic to compel others,
    casting wards around your workshop, or destabilizing the very structure of an
    opponent's spells, you know this unassuming school carries elegant power. Curriculum
    cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Message], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sigil]
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Command], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disguise
    Magic], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic Body], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic
    Weapon] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispel Magic], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translate]
    3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enthrall], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Veil
    of Privacy] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispelling Globe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Suggestion]
    5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sending], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truespeech]
    6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Repulsion], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spellwrack]
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Contingency], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Planar
    Seal] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting
    Observation] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detonate Magic] School
    Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Protective Wards]; advanced:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rune of Observation]"
